### ============================================
### 11. Fresh Test — new photos, new people
### ============================================

POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/screen
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BoundaryFresh

------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="front-smile"; filename="p2-front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:/Drishti/test-images-2/p2-front.jpg
------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="upper-arch"; filename="p2-upper.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:/Drishti/test-images-2/p2-upper.jpg
------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lower-arch"; filename="p2-lower.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:/Drishti/test-images-2/p2-lower.jpg
------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="left-bite"; filename="p2-left.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:/Drishti/test-images-2/p2-left.jpg
------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="right-bite"; filename="p2-right.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< E:/Drishti/test-images-2/p2-right.jpg
------BoundaryFresh
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

fresh@example.com
------BoundaryFresh--


